#: page/templates/page/about.html:6
msgid ""
"En savoir plus sur la mission, les principes d'action et l'engagement de "
"Ensemble 224."
msgstr ""
"Learn more about Ensemble 224's mission, guiding principles, and commitment."

#: page/templates/page/about.html:7 page/templates/page/about.html:20
#: page/templates/page/about.html:25
msgid "À propos de Ensemble 224"
msgstr "About Ensemble 224"

#: page/templates/page/about.html:8
msgid ""
"Découvrez comment Ensemble 224 facilite la solidarité en Guinée à travers "
"les alertes et les financements."
msgstr ""
"Discover how Ensemble 224 facilitates solidarity in Guinea through alerts "
"and funding."

#: page/templates/page/about.html:26
msgid ""
"Une plateforme citoyenne pour signaler, mobiliser, vérifier et soutenir, "
"avec un objectif simple : rendre l'entraide plus visible et plus efficace."
msgstr ""
"A civic platform to report, mobilize, verify, and support, with a simple "
"goal: making mutual aid more visible and effective."

#: page/templates/page/about.html:34
msgid "Vision"
msgstr "Vision"

#: page/templates/page/about.html:35
msgid "Pourquoi Ensemble 224 existe"
msgstr "Why Ensemble 224 exists"

#: page/templates/page/about.html:36
msgid ""
"Dans de nombreuses situations, l'information circule mal, l'urgence n'est "
"pas structurée et la solidarité manque d'outils fiables. Ensemble 224 "
"cherche à combler ce manque."
msgstr ""
"In many situations, information travels poorly, urgency is unstructured, and "
"solidarity lacks reliable tools. Ensemble 224 aims to bridge this gap."

#: page/templates/page/about.html:42
msgid "Notre mission"
msgstr "Our mission"

#: page/templates/page/about.html:43
msgid ""
"Ensemble 224 aide la communauté à publier et suivre les alertes de perte de "
"biens ou de proches, à partager les informations utiles et à mobiliser un "
"financement solidaire pour des besoins médicaux ou communautaires."
msgstr ""
"Ensemble 224 helps the community publish and track alerts for lost items or "
"missing loved ones, share useful information, and mobilize solidarity "
"funding for medical or community needs."

#: page/templates/page/about.html:44
msgid ""
"Notre rôle n'est pas seulement de diffuser une demande : nous voulons rendre "
"les situations plus lisibles, plus partageables et plus crédibles afin "
"d'augmenter les chances de réponse."
msgstr ""
"Our role goes beyond broadcasting a request: we want to make situations "
"clearer, more shareable, and more credible to increase the chances of a "
"response."

#: page/templates/page/about.html:49 page/templates/page/contact.html:66
msgid "Ensemble 224"
msgstr "Ensemble 224"

#: page/templates/page/about.html:58
msgid "Visibilité"
msgstr "Visibility"

#: page/templates/page/about.html:59
msgid ""
"Rendre les alertes et les besoins visibles rapidement auprès du bon public."
msgstr ""
"Make alerts and needs visible quickly to the right audience."

#: page/templates/page/about.html:65
msgid "Confiance"
msgstr "Trust"

#: page/templates/page/about.html:66
msgid ""
"Favoriser des informations mieux structurées et des parcours plus clairs."
msgstr ""
"Promote better-structured information and clearer user journeys."

#: page/templates/page/about.html:72
msgid "Solidarité"
msgstr "Solidarity"

#: page/templates/page/about.html:73
msgid ""
"Faciliter l'engagement des particuliers, des proches et des partenaires."
msgstr ""
"Facilitate engagement from individuals, loved ones, and partners."

#: page/templates/page/about.html:79
msgid "Respect"
msgstr "Respect"

#: page/templates/page/about.html:80
msgid "Traiter les informations personnelles avec prudence et responsabilité."
msgstr ""
"Handle personal information with care and responsibility."

#: page/templates/page/about.html:88
msgid "Fonctionnement"
msgstr "How it works"

#: page/templates/page/about.html:89
msgid "Comment la plateforme agit"
msgstr "How the platform works"

#: page/templates/page/about.html:90
msgid ""
"Un parcours simple, pensé pour passer plus vite de l'information à l'action."
msgstr ""
"A simple flow designed to move faster from information to action."

#: page/templates/page/about.html:97
msgid "Publier"
msgstr "Publish"

#: page/templates/page/about.html:98
msgid ""
"Une alerte de perte ou une demande de financement est soumise avec les "
"informations utiles."
msgstr ""
"A loss alert or funding request is submitted with the relevant details."

#: page/templates/page/about.html:104
msgid "Partager"
msgstr "Share"

#: page/templates/page/about.html:105
msgid ""
"La communauté peut relayer, consulter et diffuser les informations "
"importantes."
msgstr ""
"The community can relay, view, and spread important information."

#: page/templates/page/about.html:111
msgid "Mobiliser"
msgstr "Mobilize"

#: page/templates/page/about.html:112
msgid ""
"Les personnes concernées ou solidaires peuvent agir, contacter, soutenir ou "
"financer."
msgstr ""
"Affected or supportive people can take action, reach out, support, or fund."

#: page/templates/page/about.html:118
msgid "Suivre"
msgstr "Track"

#: page/templates/page/about.html:119
msgid ""
"Le statut évolue avec la situation pour garder une information actuelle et "
"utile."
msgstr ""
"Status updates as the situation evolves to keep information current and "
"useful."

#: page/templates/page/about.html:127
msgid "Engagement"
msgstr "Commitment"

#: page/templates/page/about.html:128
msgid "Nos principes d'action"
msgstr "Our principles of action"

#: page/templates/page/about.html:134
msgid ""
"Nous attachons une attention particulière à la confidentialité, à la clarté "
"des informations publiées et à la responsabilité dans les parcours de "
"soutien. Certaines situations demandent de la discrétion, d'autres de la "
"rapidité : la plateforme doit servir les deux."
msgstr ""
"We pay special attention to confidentiality, clarity of published "
"information, and accountability in support journeys. Some situations call "
"for discretion, others for speed: the platform must serve both."

#: page/templates/page/about.html:135
msgid ""
"Nous cherchons aussi à rendre les contributions solidaires plus lisibles, "
"afin que les personnes qui aident comprennent mieux le contexte, les besoins "
"et l'usage attendu des fonds."
msgstr ""
"We also strive to make solidarity contributions clearer so that people who "
"help better understand the context, needs, and intended use of funds."

#: page/templates/page/about.html:140
msgid "Ce que nous voulons renforcer"
msgstr "What we want to strengthen"

#: page/templates/page/about.html:142
msgid "la qualité des informations partagées"
msgstr "the quality of shared information"

#: page/templates/page/about.html:143
msgid "la rapidité de mise en relation"
msgstr "the speed of connecting people"

#: page/templates/page/about.html:144
msgid "la transparence des demandes"
msgstr "the transparency of requests"

#: page/templates/page/about.html:145
msgid "la confiance dans l'entraide numérique"
msgstr "trust in digital mutual aid"

